    "description": "Aratt Avant Twilight by Arattukulam is a stylish apartment community set in the peaceful locale of Huskur, Bangalore. Crafted for modern lifestyles, this project blends smart design with essential amenities to offer comfort, convenience, and a sense of belonging. With excellent connectivity, serene surroundings, and thoughtfully planned living spaces, it presents an ideal setting for families and professionals seeking a balanced urban life.\r\n",
    "builderDescription": "The word ARATT denotes several traits such as creativity, respectability, trustworthiness and dynamism. Little wonder we chose this name for our organization that was conceptualized as a builder with exceptional strengths, about 2 decades ago, in Bengaluru.\r\n\r\nToday, with proven abilities reflected in the numerous edifices we have created in the city and with a well-earned reputation for reliability, transparency, quality and customer orientation, Aratt is forging ahead with newer and more novel developments.\r\n\r\nOur flagship projects have been mostly in the coveted South quadrant of Bengaluru. Today, Aratt is literally breaking new ground in other prime locations.\r\n\r\nOur range of products include residential, commercial, hospitality projects and fully developed plots. We’re particularly known for our aesthetic design value, innovations and superior quality – all on par with high global standards, all delivered on time.\r\n\r\nCome, explore our past and ongoing bespoke work showcased in this website. Visually treat yourself to our remarkable creations. Appreciate the opportunities for fine living that thousands of our delighted customers have taken. Be fully convinced and make an Aratt home your future destination for a glorious lifestyle, for generations to come.\r\n\r\nClose\r\nWith in-house expertise in contemporary architecture, efficient project management, strict quality control, etc., we consistently exceed customer expectations. Reason why our brand has catapulted to newer heights and garnered wider clientele.\r\n\r\nAs a policy Aratt associates itself with the best brands for all construction materials. Cutting corners is not in our DNA. While we may overwhelm you with the fabulous designs of our projects, we never surprise you with hidden costs.\r\n\r\nWe stand by our core values of trust and business integrity, which have been inculcated to every employee in Aratt. How else can we make your dreams come true if the entire organization doesn’t work to reach a unified goal in an honest fashion?\r\n\r\nApart from extraordinary designs, the standard features in all projects are spaciousness and abundant amenities that gratify a modern lifestyle. Yes of course, we greatly value eco-friendliness and ensure environmentally sustainable practices for green living.\r\n\r\nTurn to fine living made finer. Come to Aratt. Change the way you live.",
